	(gr_text "Notes\n\n- target manufacturer: JLC\n	- fab general capabilies table: https://jlcpcb.com/events/6-layer-pcb\n	- price range: quoted from JLC 9/18/2026 , https://jlcpcb.com/6-layer-pcb\n		{dblquote}{dblquote}{dblquote}\n 			A 6-layer, 50x50mm board with ENIG 2u{dblquote} surface finish starts at \n			just $2 (for 5 pcs), and larger sizes such as the 6-layer \n			100x100mm boards begin at $35.1 (5 pcs). \n		{dblquote}{dblquote}{dblquote}\n- Hammond Enclosure: https://www.hammfg.com/files/parts/pdf/1593KBK.pdf\n	- general internal dimensions\n		- screw boss height: 			4.5mm\n		- height (in/out of schematic):	22.0mm\n		- length (schematic up/down):	58.66mm\n		- width (schematic left/right):	55.0mm\n	- other noteable dimensions:\n		- SFP height ~8.5mm housing, ~12.36mm socket-end (overhanging pcb)\n	- the mounting screws are infact off center. by like 0.3mm\n- stackup\n	1. sig / pwr	red\n	2. gnd			lime\n	--- core ---------------\n	3. sig / pwr	orange\n	4. gnd			cyan\n	--- core ---------------\n	5. sig / pwr	pink\n	6. gnd			blue"
